{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>You shall not approach.</b> A euphemism for lying with, as in ״ואבימלך לא קרב אליה״ (and Avimelekh did not approach her), and ״ואקרב אל הנביאה״ (and I approached the prophetess)." "<b>You shall not approach.</b> It is in the plural here, to teach you that the woman, too, is forewarned."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:13:07.327512092Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}